# Script Kitty - .dotstack Configuration

## Stack Specification
name: Script Kitty
tagline: Your Patch Cat
version: 0.1.0
architecture_pattern: Modular Monorepo (Hexagonal Domain Engine + Async Agent Runtime)

## Micro-Stack Matrix
frontend:
  framework: TypeScript (Vite + Vanilla CSS)
  path: apps/ui
  aesthetic: Sleek Cyberpunk Dark Mode (High-contrast green/purple accents)

orchestration:
  runtime: Node.js (TypeScript)
  services:
    - apps/server (API Gateway & Workflow Engine)
    - apps/cli (Developer & Operator Shell)
    - apps/mcp-server (Model Context Protocol Gateway)
  mcp_tools:
    - scout_target
    - verify_finding
    - generate_patch
    - run_recheck
    - audit_log_inspect

agent_runtime:
  runtime: Python 3.11+
  packages:
    - packages/agent_runtime (PREVC Harness & Subagent Manager)
    - packages/scanners (Exposure & Fingerprint Discovery)
    - packages/validators (Guardrail & Prompt Injection Tester)
    - packages/remediation (Patch Cat Mitigation Generator)

high_trust_core:
  language: Rust (2021 Edition)
  packages:
    - packages/policies (Zero-Trust Policy Engine)
    - packages/audit (Hash-Chained Cryptographic Audit Logger)

## Runtime & Isolation
deployment: Docker-first / Self-hosted
sandbox_profiles:
  scout: Low risk (Read-only discovery)
  verify: Medium risk (Scoped impact check - Approval required for mutations)
  patch: Low risk (Local playbook generation)
  recheck: Low risk (Regression confirmation)
  lab: High risk (Isolated VM / Container only)

## Security Constraints
zero_trust_tools: true
approval_gate_required: true
tamper_evident_audit: true
